{"src":"id","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":222300,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"id","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":11020.869733000001,"text":"Jika Anda pernah menonton film National Treasure, Anda mungkin berpikir peta harta karun ditulis di belakang deklarasi kemerdekaan."},{"kind":"text","t":12146.515723,"text":"If you have ever watched the movie National Treasure, you might think the treasure map was written on the back of the declaration of independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":12315.455269,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12318.973072,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12321.776556,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12325.276388,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12328.229210000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":12331.564425,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12332.643197000001,"samples":20592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":19164.109501,"text":"Coklat panas itu memenuhi standar Belgia. Jus buah mahal tetapi lezat."},{"kind":"text","t":19547.8616,"text":"The hot chocolate meets Belgian standards. Fruit juice is expensive but delicious."},{"kind":"audio","t":19647.964777,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19652.881136,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":19654.873773,"samples":15464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"audio","t":19733.218887,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19734.838050000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":19735.372092,"samples":12464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":31202.348040999997,"text":"Namun itu tidak benar, meskipun ada tulisan di belakangnya dokumen ini bukan beta harta karun"},{"kind":"text","t":32089.867940000004,"text":"But that's not true; although there is writing on the back, this document is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"audio","t":32193.494988,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32194.898615,"samples":15832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"audio","t":32271.790883,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32276.791091,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":32282.171183,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32285.600066,"samples":25896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":43052.676956,"text":"Anda dapat juga ingin meminta saran dari pemerintah lain selain dari pemerintah Anda sendiri tetapi nasihat mereka dirancang untuk warganya"},{"kind":"text","t":43996.390222,"text":"You may also want to seek advice from governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their own citizens."},{"kind":"audio","t":44109.056272,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":44114.438574,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":44119.56279,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":44124.792214,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":44130.128777,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":44135.729785,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1010},{"kind":"audio","t":44136.01453,"samples":5592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":53386.596127,"text":"Pulau Hong Kong merupakan asal dari nama wilayah Hong Kong dan merupakan tempat yang dianggap banyak tulis sebagai fokus utama."},{"kind":"text","t":54402.97152,"text":"Hong Kong Island is the origin of the name of the Hong Kong region and is considered by many writers to be the primary focus."},{"kind":"audio","t":54522.028336,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54526.962105,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54532.347076,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54537.427343,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54542.732346,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54547.97406,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54551.312645,"samples":24792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":63367.845748,"text":"Siapapun yang akan berkendara di garis lintang tinggi atau melintasi wilayah pegunungan"},{"kind":"text","t":63894.265836,"text":"Anyone who will be driving at high latitudes or across mountainous terrain"},{"kind":"audio","t":64005.289283000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64010.363509999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64015.430175999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64020.383344999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":64020.716759999996,"samples":928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":68512.293289,"text":"perlu memperhitungkan kemungkinan salju es atau suhu peku."},{"kind":"text","t":69171.27115,"text":"needs to take into account the possibility of snow, ice, or freezing temperatures."},{"kind":"audio","t":69278.714136,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69283.880601,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69289.043546,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":69294.365929,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69296.474084,"samples":17728,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":80879.463029,"text":"Segregasi dan rekombinasi mengocok variasi pulak-balik antara dua kolam dengan masing-masing generasi"},{"kind":"text","t":81536.555891,"text":"Segregation and recombination shuffle variation back and forth between two pools with each generation."},{"kind":"audio","t":81648.114709,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81653.149246,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81658.573527,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81663.932739,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81669.048545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81673.6409,"samples":31160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":630},{"kind":"input","t":89433.312895,"text":"Istilah serangga digunakan oleh ahli entomologi dalam arti formal untuk kelompok serangga ini."},{"kind":"text","t":90161.412211,"text":"The term insect is used by entomologists in a formal sense for this group of insects."},{"kind":"audio","t":90276.657519,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":90281.966942,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90287.256825,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90292.608607,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90294.757392,"samples":18328,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":97443.059943,"text":"Pertama, kebanyakan pengemudi memakai sepatu boot mengemudi dengan tumit dan sol yang halus dan sempit."},{"kind":"text","t":98073.205178,"text":"First, most drivers wear driving boots with smooth and narrow heels and soles."},{"kind":"audio","t":98181.018588,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98186.169313,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98191.27187,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98196.822828,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":98197.136323,"samples":6328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":109731.22638000001,"text":"Pemeriksaan tersebut merupakan respon martiri atas protes anti rezim yang meluas yang dimulai pada Oktober"},{"kind":"text","t":110493.24197,"text":"The investigation was a retaliatory response to widespread anti-regime protests that began in October."},{"kind":"audio","t":110604.490874,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110607.620882,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110612.190737,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":110616.417848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":110619.86954100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110622.907801,"samples":31760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"input","t":121705.878545,"text":"Grup memadam bakaran akhirnya berhasil memadamkan api pada pukul 23.35"},{"kind":"text","t":122406.057039,"text":"The firefighting group finally managed to extinguish the fire at 23:35."},{"kind":"audio","t":122518.941126,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122523.960574,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122529.194838,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122534.301594,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122537.494932,"samples":23728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":310},{"kind":"input","t":132132.60153199997,"text":"Badai ke-10 dari musim badai Atlantik yang diberi nama badai subtropis ciri terbentuk di samudera Atlantik hari ini."},{"kind":"text","t":133112.277358,"text":"The 10th storm of the Atlantic hurricane season, named subtropical storm Ciri, formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"audio","t":133233.57521699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133238.839181,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133243.90788699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133249.575174,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133254.40351499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133259.72010799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":133261.04765599998,"samples":13392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":140331.28269899997,"text":"Ini mengantarkan kita ke kereta, mobil, dan banyak alat transportasi lainnya."},{"kind":"text","t":140963.09407599998,"text":"This leads us to trains, cars, and many other means of transportation."},{"kind":"audio","t":141071.80912199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141077.050766,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":141082.194111,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141087.83140899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":141088.16484299998,"samples":5728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":148694.331028,"text":"Kemasyurannya sebagai pusat kemewahan berawal dari tahun 400 sampai sekitar tahun 1100."},{"kind":"text","t":149673.497472,"text":"Its fame as a center of luxury began from the year 400 until around the year 1100."},{"kind":"audio","t":149790.181356,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149795.162835,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1010},{"kind":"audio","t":149800.33635,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149805.516045,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149810.892756,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149812.64780699997,"samples":16160,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":156903.760028,"text":"Permukaan bulan tersusun dari bebatuan dan debu. Lapisan terluar bulan dinamakan kerak."},{"kind":"text","t":157466.820484,"text":"The moon's surface is composed of rocks and dust. The outermost layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"audio","t":157572.35511099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":157577.52360599997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157580.88981099997,"samples":25064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"audio","t":157646.248608,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157651.35086399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":157654.75263799998,"samples":25664,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":169341.050827,"text":"US Corps of Engineers memperkirakan bahwa curah hujan sebesar 6 inci ini mampu menerobos tanggul yang sudah rusak."},{"kind":"text","t":170185.828438,"text":"The US Army Corps of Engineers estimates that this 6-inch rainfall could breach the damaged levee."},{"kind":"audio","t":170301.248003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170306.26604999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":170311.64145199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170316.96401499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170322.259168,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":170322.60577199998,"samples":8960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":180272.62383599998,"text":"Secara khusus dinyatakan bahwa kita dapat mendeteksi apakah seseorang berbohong dengan mengamati ekspresi mikronya"},{"kind":"text","t":181042.91194999998,"text":"It is specifically stated that we can detect whether someone is lying by observing their micro-expressions."},{"kind":"audio","t":181159.02318299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":181163.99787199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":181169.19885599997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":181174.53279899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":181179.72138399997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":